<title>USA: Lancaster Colony CFO John Boylan adds title.</title>
<headline>Lancaster Colony CFO John Boylan adds title.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lancaster Colony Corp said on Monday that chief financial officer John Boylan received the additional title of vice president.</p>
<p>Boylan was most recently treasurer at the company, Lancaster Colony said.</p>
